From 08fde92f919fb08a64388648ae6aa1ee5bc689c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rishabh Kothari <rishkoth@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Jan 2026 11:22:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] mplane-changes

FR108021 - QNCM Discovery API Redesign

Improve log usage for libraries

read authorized_keys from /etc/mplane/.ssh

Make hostkey insertion compatible with earlier yang modules

Also clean-up netopeer2's setup.sh script, only install
minimal set of yang modules

Send o-ran-operations:reset when max call home attempts have been made

Add diag logging.

Init and deinit diag.

Add prefix NP2 to diag logs. Only use diag if DIAG_LOGGING flag is set.

Link with diag-library if it is found. Use different logging levels based on priority.

Remove extra linking of diag library.

Diag should only be linked if the diag library is found.

Moved ietf-netconf features from ietf-library to setup.sh

Send success-vote to ab-updater if the libsetsuccessvoter library is found.

Update dscp on netopeer2 socket

refactor create subscription with upstream BUGFIX

Add timestamp to np2 logs

Fix Max callhome reset callback

Add support for o-ran streams

Signed-off-by: Romain Chaumontet <rchaumon@qti.qualcomm.com>

Signed-off-by: Rishi Singh <quic_rishikan@quicinc.com>
